agent-hub
=========

This product includes text and code derived from third-party software:

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
hermes-agent — https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
(commit ccc695635094d7615373db267b77f894d978b1a0)

Used in agent-hub:
- src/agent_hub/learning/prompts/hermes_review.py  — background review prompts
  (_MEMORY_ROUTING_BLOCK, _MEMORY_REVIEW_PROMPT, _LESSON_LAYER_BLOCK,
  _DO_NOT_CAPTURE_BLOCK, _SKILL_REVIEW_PROMPT, _COMBINED_REVIEW_PROMPT),
  copied verbatim from agent/background_review.py; tool names are renamed at
  render time only.
- src/agent_hub/learning/prompts/hermes_curator.py — CURATOR_REVIEW_PROMPT,
  copied verbatim from agent/curator.py.
- src/agent_hub/learning/threats.py — threat pattern list and invisible-unicode
  set adapted from tools/threat_patterns.py.

